#: scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b020b61a5ee0d2c9fe13849f033ad5fec14b5b23b074fe5763c8c2180b3985a
#. default-sha256: 68164022c1646df08335f050da28685bb18279408961b2f337cb26a1e1178580
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_688A4793_C7AA_462A_9611_F83DFB13851F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Several days passed by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Vários dias se passaram."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ed91d265bad9dbe6c7ed5f097db933a5f0daf46718ec31dff66512bd0a19f90
#. default-sha256: 04cedf72104e2f57204ee32cd511746abaf5f789cce8fc3fccd1fe8725bc6c69
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A9D3DC6_28F0_486B_93BA_C817C90E1C9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As Bestia began to act more like a person, the mansion followed suit, slowly becoming more "
"habitable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not yet back to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫À medida que Bestia começou a agir mais como uma pessoa, a mansão seguiu o exemplo, "
"lentamente se tornando mais habitável—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫embora ainda não tivesse voltado à sua antiga "
"glória."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f036792272aebb35ba09cc55bf388dccf2c103df6f314939c0cf30a2de651ca2
#. default-sha256: ab2c2cf76ed105fb62a8a8ab06cfeae74a7d375981729f010e8f705912629e73
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACFE5913_A744_4DEE_B2EA_51398CC5D283"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No flowers grew in the garden, but neither were there weeds infesting it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nenhuma flor crescia no jardim, mas também não havia ervas daninhas infestando-o."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1ac2c2810294f15feac3842ca2ac3f5f791f56645e2588113576dd7131198bf
#. default-sha256: b10b64d586020a5bd47b283911d30b914ce8db1635f722fc2e02b7183657401d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B1167F3A_75E6_4D6A_9C89_AE907DFA03DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The dusty corridors, shattered windows, rust-covered kitchen gradually returned to their "
"proper states."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os corredores empoeirados, as janelas quebradas, a cozinha coberta de ferrugem, gradualmente "
"retornaram ao seu devido estado."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0aeaa236f4d20bdd0c40767e3bd296503e77c405176c84fe5e0593939d36dfd4
#. default-sha256: 96ffb35bd7a5756d48ff11ea378b7e35922554e9210efa1c0570a8a7650c9578
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF333379_324E_411C_8BA8_4A1292D3806C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia learned how to change his own clothes, and how to draw a bath."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bestia aprendeu a trocar de roupa e a preparar um banho."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dfccd7ca44c2b1e19b43a02167594de3678d2498aa3608ab33af8b57f3553c7
#. default-sha256: e70dc1ae42ba0ee2c627736ea4c6ca3edc5edba97f15d4b0fc80fcd01246df67
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5BA30A1_9184_4D30_8872_75DAB8B5F415"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer did I have to wait on him hand and foot; he could take care of a number of things "
"all by himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não precisava mais atendê-lo dos pés à cabeça; ele poderia cuidar de uma série de coisas "
"sozinho."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eba0b2b45932df7b46b92245a05ed5e3a4d337a52db4b9abcee0d28941fa8063
#. default-sha256: 9b5d8e3f8174011189b77c457702046a3f3bd2f79105b32a916fd5785d65a58a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D79B220E_57C9_4DED_A57C_2075A463BBEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What we lacked for food, he acquired from the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O que nos faltava de comida, ele adquiriu da floresta."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e26866d5207b6ba9d5f2b554b05ead2b8522d20eea7a4c7f463d086c42dfc28e
#. default-sha256: 16f5d6fdccbd53c2e7acf444204fe4a01e3fca5989251e937e311af04e66f722
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7D2B203C_1FCD_46CD_A028_6F38D55124CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Never did he go to purchase supplies from the village; rather, he captured hares and "
"gathered herbs hidden in the overgrowth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nunca ia comprar mantimentos na aldeia; em vez disso, ele capturou lebres e colheu ervas "
"escondidas no mato."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90aaf6a6f222c5722524bc80108f4ea796cb4eebffa435e831904a1eba03acc7
#. default-sha256: f5bf9b288edd5f51dd931dd5de9c06514c006d3839e9fa5fe4d67e1bc3c19f94
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4A1DA3C5_BFC4_4B16_8A65_3C6D191A453C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They were days without incident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Foram dias sem incidentes."

#: scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe31f5c334a4fee6e1653867e1083c9e39f0270dd4e1063292032df9911a4bcb
#. default-sha256: 433612a4a0372e7f3647bd9a556ae5ba539bb879474a5087e701da49cc54f2f9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_498053BB_5921_4AC8_8CEE_B4D7B6C92591"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And though such a life may be want for excitement,⟪k:1⟫peace is something that you mustn’t "
"take for granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E embora tal vida possa ser carente de excitação,⟪k:1⟫a paz é algo que você não deve tomar "
"como garantida."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e3e96ec3237633f2b832d79ae3ce5951f637047458356bd28f76e9d3d198e7c
#. default-sha256: 3958cb024641f7b6a13a2966982381732642d4fb28dd174a56f1e7d10c0a7937
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3B91922_7A77_4BCF_8186_25A36F31B2A8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those who have it cast it aside, finding the leisurely flow of time dull.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Only "
"those who have never experienced it truly know how precious it is."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aqueles que a têm a deixam de lado, achando o fluxo vagaroso do tempo maçante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Só "
"aqueles que nunca experimentaram realmente sabem o quão preciosa ela é."

#: scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 050b4ee2e765587b9c036a2e4b331bcf27ce4e98af3d207b67a250112bc361e4
#. default-sha256: 55b8f808cd550ece77bdfa037efe575462e001143ce3126f91e0d3508d9e38e7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_182E1A71_E6E2_42FE_8B96_352D86C0011C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia appeared to be content.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He wore an expression of solitary serenity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bestia parecia estar contente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele tinha uma expressão de serenidade solitária."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b035cadbac928dfcf4e29ddc6fb58007be9dc2243d10acc8bdcda83793144da7
#. default-sha256: e49660e19a3971d0d379837546bb168e8f5d2de50eca7b6289f17519efdab9d2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ABF7C6D5_59BA_4D62_B4E5_B76C6FDAE414"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Is anyone there?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Alguém...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tem alguém aí?!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ab8d88e659c579289b4c14f2010fa1b60140e0adf188e2c4b41e371bfabf4b5
#. default-sha256: 62eee06997b3596fbf42a4a45af3455e1b3fbd8574728e288bc8fa6cf37e6ffb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8049308_610B_4CC1_946D_875B4B2BC5C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, a crack formed in the uneventful tranquility."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E então, um dia, uma rachadura se formou na tranquilidade."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1077783b7b1d6a4fbc38a0b833f77d3b8c16b45af3f1dfbea9ddb48889867f
#. default-sha256: 7bdc5b640502071bf4419b2a0fd8bb0fe5af6c69381c7c0bcc5c54ca7c09092e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BDA3B870_0269_45BA_B4DC_4E13089C6B6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Is anyone... ⟪k:1⟫in there?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Could you part with some food?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I don’t need "
"much..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tem alguém...⟪k:1⟫aí?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Você poderia dar um pouco de comida?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Não preciso de "
"muito..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ae1475a16da169ce4de8f779b20639aa772982c056b66933d9f25153aeba58f
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33F944EF_4505_43BF_B4AF_F877BE36926E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be252327cc030b280462ba4a597a69a70084a53144988b534b0a94ef50b7d750
#. default-sha256: 574d45753135137325ddece56de55ed5eacc7325fa404eb55381c87cf9b1993e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAD05A95_0B56_410E_BC7C_F06F9807B5D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Some food and water...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Just a little... ⟪k:4⟫that’s all I need."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Um pouco de comida e água...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Só um pouco...⟪k:4⟫isso é tudo de que preciso."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e5b616bb44752fef15cf6c174da6ee0d435e5ce415ccad0f9989d351b3e5317
#. default-sha256: 1d8435cf5cc496404cc629779e178b6c98f8fa44b9916edd465f4cd00687f941
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE3A043A_8F3C_453F_98D4_DF29A893202B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia looked over at me, as if seeking my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bestia olhou para mim, como se procurasse minha ajuda."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91542496d795a3e480311a6f3b6646b3780182b05371dec1b1d246963ceeed74
#. default-sha256: 0a94ad4abc2adc5f993db85b9bd0d60dca4e66ea63c342704213bebe59f7cbb3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E65CAEF0_5F18_4805_8B03_1F48719B3E39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ironic, no? It was the visitor who was truly in need of aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Irônico, não? Era o visitante quem realmente precisava de ajuda."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e649dbce55e69a576a7b3c0510b050ac23dc728a47def6f4bdab0d19707279b3
#. default-sha256: df564a7521bbb258d741bd4e3f7c0ac1d092c7f8471078a206bdaddab21b2db1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D5B67BE0_04FF_4A18_A5C4_57489152C1D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I pondered it for a few moments, deciding that I could not simply turn away someone calling "
"upon the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu ponderei por alguns momentos, decidindo que eu não poderia simplesmente recusar alguém "
"chamando à porta da mansão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce48b77bf19f70655c973914b0e201a69202b96f1bf856194797e25742da6fab
#. default-sha256: af278f54a97bd2a856a653492d63423bb0f68c9e0fabb269f966b77d46f74fc9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3568FBEE_CF43_4B9F_9C82_B064DA91EB44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had Bestia ordered me to not let him in, I would have followed his instructions, but he said "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se Bestia tivesse ordenado que eu não o deixasse entrar, eu teria seguido suas instruções, "
"mas ele não disse nada."

#: scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf403807fd7f0daf3ac419a15086cbdf797df182988f0f45b3f92b8b9e8bc2de
#. default-sha256: 8833ed870d52e1b60815eac22e08162129217d9393b60bf17e52679198738322
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_904ED7C5_5FA3_4C11_A82D_51289CA1420B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, thank God... ⟪k:9⟫someone’s here.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I "
"was afraid it was deserted..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Oh, graças a Deus...⟪k:9⟫alguém está aqui.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫Fiquei com medo de que estivesse deserta..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 307fa98532dac009055f2873649ffda7d845da1f6a28526919c1f191323d3091
#. default-sha256: 522deecc613f061f16475f096f105f465cd9061ceb1a06ad4b63adf19c2d3f1e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_33C84E7E_AB3E_40AA_8E38_00C77DB2E306"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said you were in need of sustenance?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você disse que precisava de amparo?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a996f1cae516b51bb4c9f932e9ef41353562671faa2f93d0d3e9084d03858585
#. default-sha256: b8bde3406a905a7cf14d98c352abb0f6a5f8f70165851c5e3a996c15e1439951
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25162922_AE76_445C_BB3B_A26C45CE57B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It doesn’t have to be much.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything to quench this thirst..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Sim... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não precisa ser muito.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Qualquer coisa para matar essa "
"sede..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f675c683d50a5de1bfc8a6dfd2b51c56692ddd9fb41077e974407f0913133e2
#. default-sha256: c6d5630b90413be78a59084b319e855495e8e1ac06cdbb68452a9c0e8b874266
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4147CBC7_826A_4542_ACEC_32037E2B24DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I got lost, and it’s been several days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu me perdi, e já se passaram vários dias..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9a14d65837192622d2689d1cd1598cfeaded36a2b6e2e29f041d9400f498567
#. default-sha256: a741bba5086f53ab65fc9caf7d5e46393c677e1dc0679e8b370c7762b97a26c6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F9CF7669_9227_4694_914C_94455E2A07A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Give me a few minutes, I will find—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dê-me alguns minutos, eu vou encontrar—"

#: scenario2:scenario2_AC9BD4EF_8269_46C5_995F_F13494636F77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd7b767945579d7c7c1d5b82b8562a176030aca9bc81989552dc1d4c5a8b9ba4
#. default-sha256: 4aaa53ae24b5711de3622ab5e63fffe457e1f029ce58948f5e1c7abc55056587
